                <pb facs="1309" n="1113" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1113"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860c.20/7–2045</note>
                <head>No. 1123<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Deputy Political Adviser at Allied
                        Force Headquarters</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Offie</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/> No. 1247</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Allied
                                Force Headquarters</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-20">July 20, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Transmitting Minutes of the Meeting between Field Marshal Alexander and Lieutenant General Anders.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my telegram No. 2979,
                    July 18, 10 a.m.,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1123-f1"/> I have the honor to transmit
                    herewith a copy of the minutes of a meeting between Field Marshal Alexander and Lieutenant General Anders, Commander of the
                    Second Polish Corps, Italy, held at Caserta on July 13, 1945. The Department
                    will note that General Anders stated
                    that he would do everything possible to expedite the repatriation to Poland of
                    those members of his army who desired to be repatriated.</p>
                <p>It should also be observed that General
                        Anders reassured to the Supreme Allied Commander that he would
                    maintain the morale and discipline of Polish troops in Italy.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed>C. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Offie</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d1123-a1.xml" xpointer="d1123-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
